# BOOLEAN: Boolean is a tool session as UE UCSGMeshesTool - the result of a 100 cm Box and a radius-50 Sphere previews on the Box (the Sphere hidden), a change of operation recomputes it, Cancel leaves both inputs, Accept writes it as one undo step
# The Box is red (CB_Red), the Sphere green (CB_Green): the preview and the result carry both inputs' materials (UE
# UCSGMeshesTool's combined material set, B's material IDs shifted past A's slots).
# The Box spans -50..50 x 0..100 x -50..50 (base pivot). The Sphere's pivot is its base, set on the Box's +X face, so
# Translation 40,60,40 puts its centre at 90,60,40 (triangulated from three views of run scn-1108-191215):
# it cuts the +X face in a 30 cm circle round (y 60, z 40), crosses the near vertical edge (x 50, z 50) at heights 32
# and 88 and bites a sliver into the +Z face. Difference leaves a spherical bite there, Union a bulge.
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 230,260,300
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.5,-0.45,-0.74
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Width 100
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Depth 100
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Height 100
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 0,0,0
Дано set selected StaticMeshComponent.MaterialSlots[0] assets:Materials/CB_Red.demat
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Sphere.Radius 50
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation 40,60,40
Дано set selected StaticMeshComponent.MaterialSlots[0] assets:Materials/CB_Green.demat
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 150,190,180
Дано run Entity Box
Дано run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Дано run Modeling "Boolean operation: Difference A - B"
Дано run Modeling "Boolean write to: Input"
Дано run Modeling "Boolean inputs: Delete Inputs"
Тогда-вид 0_inputs the red Box with the green Sphere sunk into its +X face across the near vertical edge, below the top
Когда run Modeling "Boolean tool: Boolean"
Тогда 1_preview_diff the red Box shows a smooth spherical bite (its inner wall green, from the Sphere) where the Sphere was; the Sphere itself is hidden; the tool bar at the viewport bottom reads Boolean with Accept and Cancel; Outliner still lists both Box and Sphere
Когда run Modeling "Boolean operation: Union"
Тогда 2_preview_union the Box and the Sphere fused into one surface (the sphere's dome bulging out of the Box) - the Box part red, the dome green; the tool bar still reads Boolean
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Cancel"
Тогда 3_cancel the whole Box and the Sphere in its corner, as before the tool; no tool bar; Outliner lists Box and Sphere only
Когда run Entity Box
Когда run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Когда run Modeling "Boolean operation: Difference A - B"
Когда run Modeling "Boolean tool: Boolean"
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда 4_accept the red Box with a spherical bite whose inner wall stays green (Details: Material Slots CB_Red, CB_Green), the Sphere gone from viewport and Outliner (one mesh entity, Box); no tool bar
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда 5_undo the Box is whole again and the Sphere is back in its corner; Outliner lists both
# Union of the same pair: the cut seam (a sphere over a cube corner) welds shut as UE FMeshBoolean + FBooleanMeshesOp hole fix
Когда run Entity Box
Когда run Entity "Add to selection Sphere"
Когда run Modeling "Boolean operation: Union"
Когда run Modeling "Boolean tool: Boolean"
Тогда 6_union_colors the preview is one fused surface: the Box red, the Sphere's dome bulging out of its corner green; no error in the tool bar, which reads Boolean with Accept and Cancel
Когда run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Тогда 7_union_accept one closed mesh (Box) with both colours, no holes or dark slits along the red-green seam; the Sphere gone from viewport and Outliner; no tool bar
# Close-ups of the accepted seam, each from inside the wedge between a red face and the dome (both facing the camera),
# aimed at where the seam crosses the near vertical edge - the corners where MergeEdges left the cracks.
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 23,142,117
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.298,-0.596,-0.745
Тогда-вид 9_union_seam_upper from above the +Z face, left of the near vertical edge: the green dome rises out of the red +Z face along one continuous crease that comes down from the vertical edge 12 cm below the top corner - no light slit, hole or step along it or where it meets the edge
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 29,7,112
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.3,0.35,-0.89
Тогда-вид 10_union_seam_lower low under the dome, left of the near vertical edge: the dome's green underside meets the red +Z face in one closed crease that runs up to the vertical edge - no slit or hole along it or where it meets the edge
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 81.5,73.5,-73
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.35,-0.15,0.92
Тогда-вид 11_union_seam_back from behind (-Z), outside the +X face: the red +X face at a grazing angle with the green dome bulging out of it; the curved crease between them is unbroken - no slit, hole or dark gap
Когда run View "View mode: Wireframe"
Тогда-вид 12_union_seam_wire the same back view in wireframe: the dome's triangles and the +X face's triangles share the seam curve - no gap between the two meshes along it
Когда run View "View mode: Lit"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position 150,190,180
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction -0.5,-0.45,-0.74
Когда run Action Undo
Тогда 8_union_undo the whole Box and the Sphere in its corner again; Outliner lists both
